WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.483
Native banking UI with fictional cards and simulated responses.

2
00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:57.067
Changing card usage requires review and verification of the change.

3
00:00:57.167 --> 00:01:25.650
Loss, theft and travel have separate scenarios and explicit confirmation.

4
00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:54.233
The basic demo lacks these controls; availability at the bank is unvalidated.
